cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
title: "VAULT: Vision-Aware Unified Layer for safe Traversal"
abstract: "Research artifact for the ACSOS 2026 paper. VAULT is a vision-based runtime safety framework that combines NoMaD, Depth Anything V2, and VFH* on a TurtleBot4 under ROS 2 Humble, with a Webots simulation and an evaluation harness."
